 544+ C1D3 D3 FE            out ($fe),a             ; Semiciclo NEGATIVO de la onda, BEEPER OFF.
 545+ C1D5
 546+ C1D5 08               ex af,af
 547+ C1D6
 548+ C1D6 47               ld b,a
 549+ C1D7
 550+ C1D7 10 FE        Delay_8 djnz Delay_8
